<title>POLAND: RAFAKO SWINGS TO LOSS IN JANUARY.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO SWINGS TO LOSS IN JANUARY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net loss		 3.09 vs   0.98 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   3.09 vs   1.62 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.62 vs   2.46 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   28.94 vs  31.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial boilermaker is</p>
<p>Raciborskie Fabryki Kotlow Rafako SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
